From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OrientCOMPASS <316423573+OrientCOMPASS@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 31 Oct 2026 00:40:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] nougat: raise AV SEP/link/str limits so AAC+LDAC endpoints
 register and 2+ peers can stream

Device-tested symptoms this fixes:
1. LDAC/AAC never negotiated (phone only offered SBC): the SNK SEP
   registration loop in bta_av_main.c runs index 1..BTA_AV_MAX_SEPS-1, and
   BTA_AV_MAX_SEPS was 2 -> only BTIF_SV_AV_AA_SBC_SINK_INDEX(1) registered;
   AAC_SINK(2) and LDAC_SINK(3) endpoints were never created. Raise to 4
   (matches BTIF_SV_AV_AA_SEP_INDEX) and AVDT_NUM_SEPS 3 -> 8.
2. Second peer rejected with "av scb not available for avdt connection":
   scb pool BTA_AV_NUM_STRS=2 and AVDT_NUM_LINKS=2 left no headroom once a
   stale/rc-leaked scb existed. Raise both to 4; AVDT_NUM_TC_TBL 6 -> 12
   (= SEPS + LINKS).
---
diff --git a/bta/include/bta_av_api.h b/bta/include/bta_av_api.h
--- a/bta/include/bta_av_api.h
+++ b/bta/include/bta_av_api.h
@@ -93,11 +93,14 @@
 
 /* maximum number of streams created: 1 for audio, 1 for video */
 #ifndef BTA_AV_NUM_STRS
-#define BTA_AV_NUM_STRS         2
+#define BTA_AV_NUM_STRS         4
 #endif
 
+/* SEPs: index 0 = SRC SBC, 1..3 = SNK SBC/AAC/LDAC (btif_av_co.h enum).
+ * The stock value (2) truncated SNK registration after SBC, so AAC and LDAC
+ * endpoints were never created. */
 #ifndef BTA_AV_MAX_SEPS
-#define BTA_AV_MAX_SEPS         2
+#define BTA_AV_MAX_SEPS         4
 #endif
 
 #ifndef BTA_AV_MAX_A2DP_MTU
diff --git a/include/bt_target.h b/include/bt_target.h
--- a/include/bt_target.h
+++ b/include/bt_target.h
@@ -1156,17 +1156,17 @@
 
 /* Number of simultaneous links to different peer devices. */
 #ifndef AVDT_NUM_LINKS
-#define AVDT_NUM_LINKS              2
+#define AVDT_NUM_LINKS              4
 #endif
 
 /* Number of simultaneous stream endpoints. */
 #ifndef AVDT_NUM_SEPS
-#define AVDT_NUM_SEPS               3
+#define AVDT_NUM_SEPS               8
 #endif
 
 /* Number of transport channels setup by AVDT for all media streams */
 #ifndef AVDT_NUM_TC_TBL
-#define AVDT_NUM_TC_TBL             6
+#define AVDT_NUM_TC_TBL             12
 #endif
 
 /* Maximum size in bytes of the codec capabilities information element. */
